# Load-bearing rules for devops:ci-pipeline.
# Platform config templates are reference material; the security gate is not.

pull_request_target and workflow_run run with the base repo's token :: pull_request_target
a workflow checking out fork-controlled code is flagged high severity :: high severity
the dangerous pattern is a ref resolving to the PR head :: head\.\*|pull_request\.head
executing what was checked out is what makes it exploitable :: executes what was checked out|lifecycle scripts
quality gates are added to the pipeline :: quality gate
